{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976560/extras/d567a5a83886d42720e975aad0cf51e0.poster.avif?t=1760464658\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976560/extras/d567a5a83886d42720e975aad0cf51e0.webm?t=1760464658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976560/extras/d567a5a83886d42720e975aad0cf51e0.mp4?t=1760464658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Stellara Vanguard</strong></i>, you take on the role of a warrior tasked with defending crucial planets of the Stellara Kingdom. During each match, you\u2019ll face relentless enemies, enhance your abilities, and build powerful defenses to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976560/extras/bf83d57db1ebf1953aabaedaa1860a0a.poster.avif?t=1760464658\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976560/extras/bf83d57db1ebf1953aabaedaa1860a0a.webm?t=1760464658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976560/extras/bf83d57db1ebf1953aabaedaa1860a0a.mp4?t=1760464658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Elements</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress During the Round</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to defend the vital planets of the Stellara Kingdom. To do so, you must eliminate endless hordes of enemies. During each round, you can obtain cards that grant strategic upgrades, such as freezing shots or even missile attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976560/extras/89b878a1b98859c5552ce9d1b7909674.poster.avif?t=1760464658\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976560/extras/89b878a1b98859c5552ce9d1b7909674.webm?t=1760464658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976560/extras/89b878a1b98859c5552ce9d1b7909674.mp4?t=1760464658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower Placement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To aid you in your mission, purchase, place, and upgrade various combat towers. There is a wide variety of towers at your disposal\u2014use them strategically to best match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976560/extras/49415d28ef8178e6de2a52683a0baba8.poster.avif?t=1760464658\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976560/extras/49415d28ef8178e6de2a52683a0baba8.webm?t=1760464658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976560/extras/49415d28ef8178e6de2a52683a0baba8.mp4?t=1760464658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression After Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase various upgrades and unlock new combat towers with the XP and coins collected during matches to become stronger and keep defending the Stellara Kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976560/extras/accd2daa308937d9a56a45f34cdf30e1.poster.avif?t=1760464658\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976560/extras/accd2daa308937d9a56a45f34cdf30e1.webm?t=1760464658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976560/extras/accd2daa308937d9a56a45f34cdf30e1.mp4?t=1760464658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each match, the game transforms: new combinations of upgrades, tower placements, and more aggressive enemies keep the combat intense and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the most skilled will be able to defend Stellara until the end.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976560?t=1760464658","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976560?t=1760464658","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976560/f8b3fc726631086b8ac05ed90ed26b0b21ebbb78/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760464658","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976560/f8b3fc726631086b8ac05ed90ed26b0b21ebbb78/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760464658","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4078760,"descri